  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Harvest Money Expo mission</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project, Dutch participation at the Harvest Money Expo fair 2023 will be supported. Transfer of Dutch technology, skills and knowledge will be key in this project. This should be achieved by setting up good workshops, seminars and demonstrations at the fairs and by aligning well with other initiatives supported by the Netherlands embassy in Kampala, Uganda and the Netherlands Enterprise Agency (RVO).There will be a big Netherlands Village at the well-attended fair with Dutch companies from the Netherlands, Dutch companies from the East African countries and Ugandan farmers that participate and have participated in the Best Farmer competition.</narrative>
  </description>
